Chapter: MandelKernel
  cites Gpu chapter DeviceEffect

 The Mandelbrot set, as a [Device] compute kernel. One GPU thread per pixel
 maps its (px, py) to a point c in the complex plane, iterates z = z*z + c
 counting steps until |z| escapes, and writes a colour from the escape count.
 The iteration is a tail-recursive helper -- the WGSL plug lowers it to a
 structured `loop`.

 All arithmetic is integer fixed-point at scale 1000 (three fractional
 digits). The escape test and the z-update stay well inside 32-bit range: on
 the last in-set step |z|^2 <= 4e6, so z components stay under ~2000 and their
 squares under ~1.6e7 -- no overflow.

 We say:

Section: Parameters

  mb-width : Integer = 1024
  mb-height : Integer = 768
  mb-max : Integer = 96

  mb-mod : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  mb-mod (x) (m) = x - (x / m) * m

Section: Iteration

 z = z*z + c until |z|^2 > 4 (i.e. > 4e6 in scaled units) or the step cap.

  mb-iter : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  mb-iter (zr) (zi) (cr) (ci) (n) =
    if n >= mb-max then mb-max
    else if zr * zr + zi * zi > 4000000 then n
    else mb-iter ((zr * zr - zi * zi) / 1000 + cr) (2 * zr * zi / 1000 + ci) cr ci (n + 1)

Section: Plane Mapping

 px in [0,1024) -> cr in [-2.5, 1.0]; py in [0,768) -> ci in [-1.2, 1.2].

  mb-cr : Integer -> Integer
  mb-cr (gid) = (mb-mod gid mb-width) * 3500 / mb-width - 2500

  mb-ci : Integer -> Integer
  mb-ci (gid) = (gid / mb-width) * 2400 / mb-height - 1200

Section: Colour

 Inside the set is black; escaped points get a smooth cycling palette that
 drifts with frame.

  mb-chan : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  mb-chan (it) (mul) (phase) = mb-mod (it * mul + phase) 256

  mb-color : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  mb-color (it) (frame) =
    if it >= mb-max then 0
    else let f = frame * 2
    in let r = mb-chan it 9 (f)
    in let g = mb-chan it 6 (40 + f)
    in let b = mb-chan it 13 (90 + f)
    in r * 65536 + g * 256 + b

Section: Mandelbrot Kernel

  mandel-step : Integer, Integer, Integer -> [Device] Integer
  mandel-step (outb) (frame) (gid) = act
    device-store outb gid (mb-color (mb-iter 0 0 (mb-cr gid) (mb-ci gid) 0) frame)
  end
